'' '...' is only for a CDECL procedure, fbc's error 312 -- win64, where a procedure that
'' writes no convention is stdcall. 23 errors on fbc-modern 1.20 and 1.10.1 alike, on exactly
'' these lines (2026-09-19), two of them inside 'typeof'; vararg-cdecl-linux.test holds
'' the same source on Linux.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir -target win64-msvc tests/diagnostics/src/vararg-cdecl.bas
